WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.723 --> 00:00:08.457
This small hub gathers the site's practice rooms in one place. Pick the door that matches what you need today.

2
00:00:08.457 --> 00:00:16.123
Open Personal Cartography. Place each week on a map of scholars, Nations, and ideas, and keep your own notes.

3
00:00:16.123 --> 00:00:21.925
Open the Self-Check Studio. Practise with a week's readings and save your work.

4
00:00:21.925 --> 00:00:27.916
Open Compare readings. Hold any two readings side by side and see where they meet.

5
00:00:27.916 --> 00:00:35.081
Open Build reading comprehension. Read one source closely with guided questions, then check yourself.

6
00:00:35.081 --> 00:00:38.279
Nothing behind these doors is graded.

7
00:00:38.279 --> 00:00:43.843
Where next: Start with the room the current week's page pointed you toward.
